---
title: "Fig 2.4b — Authentification OAuth GitHub"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor       User        as Utilisateur
    participant FE          as Next.js Frontend
    participant NA          as NextAuth.js
    participant BE          as NestJS API
    participant DB          as PostgreSQL
    participant GH          as GitHub OAuth
    participant JW          as JWT Service

    User->>FE: Clique "Continuer avec GitHub"
    FE->>NA: signIn("github")
    NA->>GH: Redirect → github.com/login/oauth/authorize
    activate GH
    GH-->>User: Page de consentement GitHub

    User->>GH: Autorise l'application
    GH-->>NA: Callback avec code OAuth
    deactivate GH

    activate NA
    NA->>GH: POST /login/oauth/access_token { code }
    activate GH
    GH-->>NA: { access_token, scope }
    deactivate GH

    NA->>GH: GET /user (avec access_token)
    activate GH
    GH-->>NA: { id, login, email, avatar_url }
    deactivate GH

    NA->>BE: POST /auth/oauth/github { githubId, email, name, image, access_token }
    activate BE

    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM User WHERE email = ?
    activate DB
    DB-->>BE: User | null
    deactivate DB

    alt Utilisateur inexistant (premier login)
        BE->>DB: INSERT INTO User { name, email, image, githubUsername }
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Nouvel User créé
        deactivate DB
        BE->>DB: INSERT INTO Account { userId, provider="github", ... }
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Account créé
        deactivate DB
    else Utilisateur existant
        BE->>DB: UPDATE Account SET access_token = ? WHERE provider = "github"
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Account mis à jour
        deactivate DB
    end

    BE->>JW: signAccessToken(userId, email, roles)
    BE->>JW: signRefreshToken(userId)
    activate JW
    JW-->>BE: { accessToken, refreshToken }
    deactivate JW

    BE-->>NA: 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken, user }
    deactivate BE

    NA->>NA: jwt() callback — stocke tokens dans le token JWT chiffré
    NA-->>FE: Session établie { user, accessToken }
    deactivate NA
    FE-->>User: ✅ Redirige vers /dashboard
